{
    "title": "CARFAX - Shop New & Used Cars",
    "description": "Find your next car with the CARFAX \u2013 Shop New & Used app. Search millions of new and used cars for sale from more than 28,000 dealerships nationwide. Plus, every used car listed comes with a FREE CARFAX Vehicle History Report!\r\n\r\nShop for SUVs, cars, minivans, and pickup trucks near you, all from dealerships you can trust.\r\n\r\nWith our app, you can:\r\n\r\nShop millions of new, used, and certified pre-owned cars near you\r\nUse powerful search and sort features to find your next car\r\nQuickly save your favorite cars\r\nReceive notifications, so you\u2019ll never lose track of what you\u2019ve looked at\r\nAll used and certified pre-owned listings come with a free CARFAX Vehicle History Report\r\nHow CARFAX helps:\r\n\r\nSee the accidents and service visits that have been reported to CARFAX. Get lots of details to help you make your choice.\r\nFilter your searches using CARFAX data including details on 1-Owner or Well-Maintained vehicles.\r\nSee dealership ratings and reviews \u2013 from verified customers!\r\nStart your search now!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Find your next car with the CARFAX \u2013 Shop New &amp; Used app. Search millions of new and used cars for sale from more than 28,000 dealerships nationwide. Plus, every used car listed comes with a FREE CARFAX Vehicle History Report!<br><br>Shop for SUVs, cars, minivans, and pickup trucks near you, all from dealerships you can trust.<br><br>With our app, you can:<br><br>Shop millions of new, used, and certified pre-owned cars near you<br>Use powerful search and sort features to find your next car<br>Quickly save your favorite cars<br>Receive notifications, so you\u2019ll never lose track of what you\u2019ve looked at<br>All used and certified pre-owned listings come with a free CARFAX Vehicle History Report<br>How CARFAX helps:<br><br>See the accidents and service visits that have been reported to CARFAX. Get lots of details to help you make your choice.<br>Filter your searches using CARFAX data including details on 1-Owner or Well-Maintained vehicles.<br>See dealership ratings and reviews \u2013 from verified customers!<br>Start your search now!",
